/trc/id/076771ab9f165bad9cd5d9cafebb7c08/rokuFeed/assets/8514c9c58a9655e4828f1380a72e2fdc.jpg","ep":"S02E08"},{"s":1795899623,"e":1795902668,"t":"Xena: Warrior Princess","st":"Xena: Warrior Princess","d":"Xena and Gabrielle deal with a king who forbids celebrations and threatens to close an orphanage.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/076771ab9f165bad9cd5d9cafebb7c08/rokuFeed/assets/8514c9c58a9655e4828f1380a72e2fdc.jpg","ep":"S02E09"},{"s":1795902668,"e":1795905718,"t":"Xena: Warrior Princess","st":"Xena: Warrior Princess","d":"In 1940 Gabrielle's descendant uncovers the Xena scrolls and the tomb of Ares.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/076771ab9f165bad9cd5d9cafebb7c08/rokuFeed/assets/8514c9c58a9655e4828f1380a72e2fdc.jpg","ep":"S02E10"},{"s":1795905718,"e":1795908704,"t":"Xena: Warrior Princess","st":"Xena: Warrior Princess","d":"Beauty pageant sabotage may provoke war unless contestant Xena can prevent it.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/076771ab9f165bad9cd5d9cafebb7c08/rokuFeed/assets/8514c9c58a9655e4828f1380a72e2fdc.jpg","ep":"S02E11"},{"s":1795908704,"e":1795911722,"t":"Xena: Warrior Princess","st":"Xena: Warrior Princess","d":"At the brink of death, a wounded Xena relives the events that made her a warrior.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/076771ab9f165bad9cd5d9cafebb7c08/rokuFeed/assets/8514c9c58a9655e4828f1380a72e2fdc.jpg","ep":"S02E12"},{"s":1795911722,"e":1795914771,"t":"Xena: Warrior Princess","st":"Xena: Warrior Princess","d":"The thief Autolycus helps Xena reunite her spirit with her body.","i":"https://images.sr.roku.com/idType/roku-trc/context/trc/id/076771ab9f165bad9cd5d9cafebb7c08/rokuFeed/assets/8514c9c58a9655e4828f1380a72e2fdc.jpg","ep":"S02E13"},{"s":1795914771,"e":1795917816,"t":"Xena: Warrior Princess","st":"Xena: Warrior Princess","d":"Xena pits Callisto against Velasca, the newly immortal Amazon.","i":"https://images.sr.